<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Default Action Architecture — Micro-Action Decision Engine</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root{
  --bg:#17324D;
  --bg2:#21445F;
  --card-bg:#FFFFFF;
  --card-bg-2:#F4F1E9;
  --card-border:#D9E0E5;
  --input-bg:#FFFFFF;
  --accent:#6B4A35;
  --accent-bright:#8B654B;
  --accent-glow:rgba(107,74,53,.18);
  --accent-hover:#4D3426;
  --cyan:#294F6D;
  --blue:#426C8C;
  --amber:#8B654B;
  --purple:#6B4A35;
  --text:#17324D;
  --text-soft:#334D61;
  --text-muted:#526575;
  --text-dim:#667783;
  --border:#D9E0E5;
  --code-bg:#F4F1E9;
  --radius-xl:26px;
  --radius-lg:20px;
  --radius-md:12px;
  --radius-sm:8px;
  --transition:all .25s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
}

*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}

body{
  background:#FAF9F5;
  color:#17324D;
  font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;
  min-height:100vh;
  padding:1.5rem;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}

.matrix-card{
  width:100%;
  max-width:1120px;
  margin:0 auto;
  background:#FFFFFF;
  border:1px solid #D9E0E5;
  border-radius:var(--radius-xl);
  box-shadow:0 24px 65px rgba(23,50,77,.12);
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
}

.matrix-card::before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  pointer-events:none;
  background:
    linear-gradient(rgba(23,50,77,.025) 1px,transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(23,50,77,.025) 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:42px 42px;
  mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,black,transparent 55%);
}

.matrix-card::after{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  top:0;
  left:8%;
  right:8%;
  height:2px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#6B4A35,#17324D,#6B4A35,transparent);
  box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(107,74,53,.14);
}

/* HEADER */
.engine-header{
  padding:2rem 2.25rem 1.4rem;
  background:#17324D;
  color:#FAF9F5;
  border-bottom:1px solid #294B68;
  position:relative;
  z-index:2;
}

.header-row{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:flex-start;
  gap:2rem;
}

.engine-kicker{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  color:#E7D8C8;
  font-size:.68rem;
  font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:.15em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  margin-bottom:.65rem;
}

h1{
  font-size:clamp(1.65rem,3vw,2.4rem);
  font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:-.045em;
  line-height:1.05;
}

.engine-header h1{color:#FAF9F5;}

h1 .status-dot{
  display:inline-block;
  width:9px;
  height:9px;
  background:#B58B6A;
  border-radius:50%;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(181,139,106,.16),0 0 18px rgba(181,139,106,.45);
  margin-right:.45rem;
  vertical-align:middle;
}

.subtitle{
  color:#FAF9F5;
  opacity:.84;
  font-size:.88rem;
  line-height:1.6;
  margin-top:.65rem;
  max-width:680px;
}

.streak-counter{
  flex-shrink:0;
  background:rgba(250,249,245,.09);
  border:1px solid rgba(250,249,245,.22);
  padding:.55rem .8rem;
  border-radius:10px;
  color:#E7D8C8;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  font-size:.7rem;
  font-weight:800;
  white-space:nowrap;
}

/* EDUCATIONAL INTRO */
.education-intro{
  padding:1.8rem 2.25rem;
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;
  gap:1rem;
  position:relative;
  z-index:1;
  background:#FAF9F5;
}

.intro-main{
  background:#F4F1E9;
  border:1px solid #E2D8CC;
  border-radius:16px;
  padding:1.3rem;
}

.section-eyebrow{
  color:#294F6D;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  font-size:.65rem;
  font-weight:800;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  letter-spacing:.12em;
  margin-bottom:.5rem;
}

.intro-main h2{
  color:#17324D;
  font-size:1.2rem;
  letter-spacing:-.025em;
  margin-bottom:.55rem;
}

.intro-main p{
  color:#526575;
  font-size:.82rem;
  line-height:1.65;
}

.intro-main strong{color:#334D61;}

.velocity-equation{
  margin-top:.9rem;
  padding:.75rem 1rem;
  background:#17324D;
  border:1px solid #294B68;
  border-radius:10px;
  color:#FAF9F5;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  font-size:.76rem;
  text-align:center;
}

.intro-side{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:.65rem;
}

.mini-principle{
  padding:.9rem;
  border:1px solid #D9E0E5;
  border-radius:12px;
  background:#FFFFFF;
}

.mini-principle span{
  display:block;
  color:#6B4A35;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  font-size:.6rem;
  font-weight:800;
  margin-bottom:.35rem;
}

.mini-principle strong{
  display:block;
  color:#17324D;
  font-size:.76rem;
  margin-bottom:.25rem;
}

.mini-principle p{
  color:#526575;
  font-size:.67rem;
  line-height:1.45;
}

/* SELECTOR */
.selector-area{
  padding:0 2.25rem 2rem;
  position:relative;
  z-index:2;
  background:#FAF9F5;
}

.form-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:1rem;
  margin-bottom:1rem;
}

.form-group{
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  gap:.5rem;
}

label{
  font-size:.66rem;
  font-weight:800;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  letter-spacing:.08em;
  color:#526575;
}

.select-wrapper{position:relative;}

.select-wrapper::after{
  content:'▾';
  position:absolute;
  right:1rem;
  top:50%;
  transform:translateY(-50%);
  color:#6B4A35;
  pointer-events:none;
}

select{
  width:100%;
  padding:.95rem 1rem;
  background:#FFFFFF;
  border:1px solid #C9D3DA;
  border-radius:var(--radius-md);
  color:#17324D;
  font-size:.82rem;
  font-weight:600;
  outline:none;
  cursor:pointer;
  appearance:none;
  transition:var(--transition);
}

select:focus{
  border-color:#6B4A35;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(107,74,53,.13);
}

.btn-execute{
  width:100%;
  padding:1rem;
  background:#6B4A35;
  color:#FFFFFF;
  border:none;
  border-radius:var(--radius-md);
  font-weight:800;
  font-size:.92rem;
  cursor:pointer;
  transition:var(--transition);
  box-shadow:0 7px 22px rgba(107,74,53,.18);
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  gap:.5rem;
}

.btn-execute:hover{
  background:#4D3426;
  color:#FFFFFF;
  transform:translateY(-2px);
}

/* DECISION SCIENCE GRID */
.learning-section,.execution-model,.layers-section,
.friction-section,.review-section{
  padding:0 2.25rem 2rem;
  position:relative;
  z-index:1;
  background:#FAF9F5;
}

.section-heading{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:end;
  gap:1rem;
  margin-bottom:.9rem;
}

.section-heading h2{
  color:#17324D;
  font-size:1rem;
  letter-spacing:-.02em;
}

.section-heading p{
  color:#667783;
  font-size:.7rem;
  max-width:550px;
  text-align:right;
  line-height:1.5;
}

.principles-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
  gap:.7rem;
}

.principle-card{
  background:#FFFFFF;
  border:1px solid #D9E0E5;
  border-radius:13px;
  padding:1rem;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
  transition:var(--transition);
}

.principle-card:hover{
  transform:translateY(-3px);
  border-color:#BDA58F;
  background:#F4F1E9;
}

.principle-number{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  color:#6B4A35;
  font-size:.62rem;
  font-weight:800;
  margin-bottom:.55rem;
}

.principle-card h3{
  color:#17324D;
  font-size:.78rem;
  margin-bottom:.4rem;
}

.principle-card p{
  color:#526575;
  font-size:.68rem;
  line-height:1.55;
}

.principle-card::after{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  width:45px;
  height:45px;
  right:-18px;
  bottom:-18px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:rgba(107,74,53,.09);
}

/* EXECUTION MODEL */
.execution-panel{
  background:#F4F1E9;
  border:1px solid #D9E0E5;
  border-radius:16px;
  padding:1.25rem;
}

.execution-header{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
  margin-bottom:1rem;
}

.execution-header h2{color:#17324D;font-size:.95rem;}
.execution-header span{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  color:#667783;
  font-size:.62rem;
}

.execution-flow{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);
  gap:.55rem;
}

.flow-node{
  position:relative;
  padding:.9rem .75rem;
  background:#FFFFFF;
  border:1px solid #D9E0E5;
  border-radius:10px;
  text-align:center;
}

.flow-node:not(:last-child)::after{
  content:"→";
  position:absolute;
  right:-.72rem;
  top:50%;
  transform:translateY(-50%);
  color:#6B4A35;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  z-index:3;
}

.flow-node .flow-number{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  color:#6B4A35;
  font-size:.58rem;
  font-weight:800;
}

.flow-node strong{
  display:block;
  color:#17324D;
  font-size:.7rem;
  margin:.3rem 0;
}

.flow-node p{
  color:#526575;
  font-size:.61rem;
  line-height:1.4;
}

/* OUTPUT */
.output-section{
  display:none;
  flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center;
  text-align:center;
  padding:2rem 2.25rem;
  animation:fadeIn .35s ease;
  position:relative;
  z-index:2;
  background:#FAF9F5;
  color:#17324D;
}

.output-section.active{display:flex;}

@keyframes fadeIn{
  from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px) scale(.98);}
  to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}
}

.action-badge{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  padding:.4rem .9rem;
  background:#F1E9E1;
  color:#6B4A35;
  border:1px solid #D9C7B7;
  border-radius:9999px;
  font-size:.67rem;
  font-weight:800;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  letter-spacing:.06em;
  margin-bottom:1rem;
}

.action-title{
  color:#17324D;
  font-size:1.3rem;
  font-weight:700;
  line-height:1.5;
  margin-bottom:1.3rem;
  max-width:720px;
}

.timer-container{
  position:relative;
  width:205px;
  height:205px;
  margin-bottom:1.4rem;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  filter:drop-shadow(0 0 16px rgba(107,74,53,.12));
}

.timer-svg{transform:rotate(-90deg);width:100%;height:100%;}
.timer-circle-bg{fill:none;stroke:#D9E0E5;stroke-width:7;}
.timer-circle-progress{
  fill:none;
  stroke:#6B4A35;
  stroke-width:7;
  stroke-linecap:round;
  stroke-dasharray:565.48;
  stroke-dashoffset:0;
  transition:stroke-dashoffset 1s linear;
}

.timer-display{
  position:absolute;
  color:#17324D;
  font-size:2.75rem;
  font-weight:800;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
}

.timer-controls{
  display:flex;
  gap:.75rem;
  width:100%;
  max-width:600px;
}

.btn-secondary{
  flex:1;
  padding:.9rem;
  background:#17324D;
  border:1px solid #17324D;
  color:#FFFFFF;
  border-radius:var(--radius-md);
  font-weight:700;
  font-size:.82rem;
  cursor:pointer;
  transition:var(--transition);
}

.btn-secondary:hover{
  background:#294B68;
  border-color:#294B68;
}

/* SPRINT EDUCATION */
.sprint-education{
  width:100%;
  max-width:900px;
  margin-top:1.8rem;
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:.7rem;
}

.sprint-card{
  text-align:left;
  padding:1rem;
  background:#FFFFFF;
  border:1px solid #D9E0E5;
  border-radius:12px;
}

.sprint-card span{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  color:#294F6D;
  font-size:.58rem;
  font-weight:800;
}

.sprint-card h3{color:#17324D;font-size:.74rem;margin:.35rem 0;}
.sprint-card p{color:#526575;font-size:.65rem;line-height:1.5;}

/* LIFE LAYERS */
.layer-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
  gap:.7rem;
}

.layer-card{
  padding:1rem;
  border-radius:13px;
  border:1px solid #D9E0E5;
  background:#FFFFFF;
}

.layer-card .layer-icon{
  width:30px;
  height:30px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  border-radius:8px;
  background:#F1E9E1;
  color:#6B4A35;
  margin-bottom:.7rem;
  font-size:.8rem;
}

.layer-card h3{color:#17324D;font-size:.75rem;margin-bottom:.35rem;}
.layer-card p{color:#526575;font-size:.65rem;line-height:1.5;}
.layer-card small{
  display:block;
  margin-top:.65rem;
  color:#667783;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  font-size:.57rem;
}

/* FRICTION EDUCATION */
.friction-panel{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:1rem;
  background:#F4F1E9;
  border:1px solid #D9E0E5;
  border-radius:16px;
  padding:1.2rem;
}

.friction-column{padding:.5rem;}
.friction-column:first-child{border-right:1px solid #D9E0E5;}
.friction-column h3{color:#17324D;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;}
.friction-column p{color:#526575;font-size:.7rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:.65rem;}
.friction-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.45rem;}
.friction-item{display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:flex-start;}
.friction-item b{
  color:#6B4A35;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  font-size:.6rem;
}
.friction-item span{color:#526575;font-size:.65rem;line-height:1.4;}

/* REVIEW SYSTEM */
.review-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:.7rem;
}

.review-card{
  padding:1rem;
  background:#FFFFFF;
  border:1px solid #D9E0E5;
  border-radius:12px;
}

.review-card span{
  color:#6B4A35;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  font-size:.6rem;
  font-weight:800;
}

.review-card h3{color:#17324D;font-size:.75rem;margin:.35rem 0;}
.review-card p{color:#526575;font-size:.65rem;line-height:1.5;}

/* ACCORDION */
.lesson-panel{
  margin:0 2.25rem 2rem;
  border-top:1px dashed #D9E0E5;
  padding-top:1.25rem;
  position:relative;
  z-index:2;
}

details{width:100%;}

summary{
  list-style:none;
  color:#6B4A35;
  font-size:.8rem;
  font-weight:800;
  cursor:pointer;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:.5rem;
  user-select:none;
}

summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
summary:hover{color:#4D3426;}
summary .chevron{font-size:.65rem;transition:transform .2s ease;}
details[open] summary .chevron{transform:rotate(90deg);}

.lesson-content{
  margin-top:.85rem;
  background:#FFFFFF;
  border:1px solid #D9E0E5;
  border-radius:var(--radius-md);
  padding:1.3rem;
  font-size:.75rem;
  line-height:1.7;
  color:#526575;
}

.lesson-content h3{color:#17324D;font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:.65rem;}
.lesson-content h4{color:#6B4A35;font-size:.75rem;margin:1rem 0 .3rem;}
.lesson-content p{margin-bottom:.7rem;}
.lesson-content p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}

/* FOOTER */
.engine-footer{
  background:#17324D;
  border-top:1px solid #294B68;
  padding:1rem 2.25rem;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
  gap:1rem;
  color:#FAF9F5;
  font-size:.62rem;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
}

.engine-footer strong{color:#E7D8C8;}

/* RESPONSIVE */
@media(max-width:900px){
  .education-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .principles-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  .layer-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  .execution-flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);}
}

@media(max-width:700px){
  body{padding:.6rem;}

  .engine-header,.selector-area,.learning-section,.execution-model,
  .layers-section,.friction-section,.review-section{
    padding-left:1rem;
    padding-right:1rem;
  }

  .header-row{flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;}
  .streak-counter{align-self:flex-start;}
  .form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .principles-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
  .layer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
  .execution-flow{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .flow-node:not(:last-child)::after{
    content:"↓";
    right:50%;
    top:auto;
    bottom:-.8rem;
    transform:translateX(50%);
  }
  .sprint-education,.review-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .friction-panel{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .friction-column:first-child{
    border-right:0;
    border-bottom:1px solid #D9E0E5;
    padding-bottom:1rem;
  }
  .section-heading{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;}
  .section-heading p{text-align:left;}
  .engine-footer{
    padding-left:1rem;
    padding-right:1rem;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:flex-start;
  }
  .lesson-panel{margin-left:1rem;margin-right:1rem;}
  .timer-controls{flex-direction:column;}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<main class="matrix-card">

<header class="engine-header">
  <div class="header-row">
    <div>
      <div class="engine-kicker">MICRO-ACTION DECISION SYSTEM // v2.0</div>
      <h1><span class="status-dot"></span>DEFAULT ACTION ARCHITECTURE</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Turn vague intentions into one concrete action matched to your
        available energy, time, and life domain.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="streak-counter">
      <span id="streakCount">0</span> SPRINTS DONE
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="education-intro">
  <div class="intro-main">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">DEFAULT ACTION ARCHITECTURE</div>
    <h2>Progress is often constrained by execution friction, not ambition.</h2>
    <p>
      A large goal can contain dozens of decisions. What should you do first?
      How long should you work? What if you are tired? What if the task feels
      too large? The result can be <strong>decision delay</strong>.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top:.55rem;">
      This engine reduces the problem to three variables:
      <strong>what matters, what capacity you have, and how much time is available.</strong>
      It then converts those variables into a small executable behavior.
    </p>
    <div class="velocity-equation">
      EXECUTION VELOCITY = CLARITY × CAPACITY × IMMEDIACY
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="intro-side">
    <div class="mini-principle">
      <span>01 // CLARITY</span>
      <strong>Define the next action.</strong>
      <p>A goal describes a destination. An action describes what happens next.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mini-principle">
      <span>02 // CAPACITY</span>
      <strong>Match the task to your state.</strong>
      <p>A good task for high energy may be a poor task when capacity is low.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mini-principle">
      <span>03 // FRICTION</span>
      <strong>Reduce unnecessary steps.</strong>
      <p>The more effort required to begin, the more opportunities there are to delay.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mini-principle">
      <span>04 // FEEDBACK</span>
      <strong>Measure completion.</strong>
      <p>Finished actions create information that can improve your next decision.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="selector-area" id="selectorForm">
  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="layer">1. Life Improvement Layer</label>
      <div class="select-wrapper">
        <select id="layer">
          <option value="Learning">Learning & Education</option>
          <option value="Career">Career & Professional Growth</option>
          <option value="Financial">Financial Improvement</option>
          <option value="Health">Health & Personal Wellbeing</option>
          <option value="Business">Business & Entrepreneurship</option>
          <option value="Relationships">Relationships & Communication</option>
